# {{ dataset_title or dataset_id }}

Source dataset `{{ dataset_id }}`: the files one instrument produced, indexed sample by sample
by `faire index` with the heuristic in `.faire/heuristic.py`, and described in the study's
machine-actionable data management plan (ma-DMP).

## Get the content

    datalad clone <url of this dataset> && cd <dataset>
    datalad get <path>

## Indexing

Received files are brought in with `faire index <directory> --stream {{ dataset_id }}`. The
heuristic decides, for each received sample, the instrument, the entity values, whether the
sample is a pilot, which files to keep, which are sensitive and where each is stored (see
the comments in `.faire/heuristic.py`). Each indexing commit records the entities, the pilot
status and the heuristic's revision.

